  openedCoverSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9f6ef615ea10cf47acc9940bde21fa6, type: 3}
  BookText: 'To every citizen of Virrihael,


    the one known as "The Thief Of
    The Dead" striked again, yesterday night two more graves were digged and looted,
    one of which was of a good woman and her child.


    If YOU don''t help the
    City, it will happen to you as well when you''ll join the dead. We have to stop
    this sacrilege while we are in this world, as the Gods will punish us for not
    having done so.


    Come meet me outside the Curch,

    Mother Nebivia.'
  CantBeTaken: 0
  isNoteOrScroll: 1
